      "start_seconds": 334.74,
      "end_seconds": 360.34,
      "duration_seconds": 25.6,
      "text": "all done you can get dressed okay thinking it through my working impression is heat exhaustion with some dehydration the reason I say that that is that your story and my examination fit together we shouldn't forget an electrolyte imbalance just to be sure I understood you've been feeling faint for three days and no passing no urine or fainting"
