      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.15,
      "end_seconds": 397.39,
      "duration_seconds": 34.24,
      "text": "Blood salts is what I'd like next for dehydration that will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step you'll be taking ORS 1 sachet three times a day for two days that's for dehydration avoid the midday sun for a few days and keep a water bottle with you the thing that would worry me is if you become confused or stop sweating if that happens go to emergency"
